      "source_xml_line": 164,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "And who might you be?",
      "JA_current": "で、あんたは誰なんだ？",
      "JA_new": "あんた、何者だ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_301#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 167,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_301",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Me?",
      "JA_current": "俺か？",
      "JA_new": "俺？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "301",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_302#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 170,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_302",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Exactly. You. Not me.",
      "JA_current": "もちろんだとも。あんただ。俺じゃあない。",
      "JA_new": "そう、お前だ。俺じゃない。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "302",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_303#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 173,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_303",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Haha, that's a good one! Me... What about me? I'm fine... Well, I... I make food... So, there. I'm a chef! The master of slices and spices! You know - parsley, dill, herbs, stuff like that... Bread, too... Right?",
      "JA_current": "はは、そりゃいい！ 俺は… 俺か？ 俺は、元気だよ… そう、俺… 俺は飯を作る… そう、ここで。シェフだ！ スライス＆スパイスのマスターだ！ そうさねえ ― パセリ、ディル、ハーブ、などなど… パンも… お分かり？",
      "JA_new": "はは、いい質問だな！俺か……俺がどうした？元気だよ……ええと……飯を作ってる。そうさ、料理人だ！切り分けと香辛料の達人！パセリにディル、ハーブとか……パンもあるぞ……な？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "303",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_304#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 176,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_304",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Got it.",
      "JA_current": "分かった。",
      "JA_new": "分かった。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "304",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_305#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 179,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_305",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Also, tinned foods... condensed milk with sugar... ham in a can... roast beef with tomato dressing... yeah...",
      "JA_current": "それに、缶詰め食品… 砂糖入りコンデンスミルク… ハムの缶詰… トマトドレッシングを添えたローストビーフ… いえい…。",
      "JA_new": "それに缶詰もある……練乳に、缶詰のハム、トマトソースのローストビーフ……そうそう……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "305",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_306#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 182,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_306",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I got it.",
      "JA_current": "分かったって。",
      "JA_new": "分かったよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "306",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_307#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 185,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_307",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "French bread... ketchup... eggs... brown bread... cheese, what have you. Wieners, too! And sausages! Fowl... cold, not flying.",
      "JA_current": "フランスパン… ケチャップ… 卵… 黒パン… チーズとか。ウインナーも！ それに、ソーセージ！ 鳥肉… 冷製だよ、フライじゃないよ。",
      "JA_new": "フランスパンに、ケチャップに、卵に、黒パンに、チーズ。いろいろあるぞ。ウインナーも！ソーセージも！鶏肉も……冷やしてある。空は飛ばないぞ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "307",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_308#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 188,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_308",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "OK, fine, I understand! Tell me your name at least.",
      "JA_current": "もういいよ、よく分かった！ せめて名前を教えてくれ。",
      "JA_new": "分かった分かった。名前だけでも教えてくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "308",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_common3_309#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 191,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_common3_309",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Huh?.. Oh! Slavik is my name... that's just a label... No! It's an apron! I've got this white apron... Hey, look... Sit down, don't be a target... 'Cause, that sniper, you know... pick you off! .. They're, you know... They're like that...",
      "JA_current": "んん？… おお！ Slavik が俺の名… これは、単にラベルだ… 違った！ これは、エプロンだ！ 俺はこの白いエプロンを身に着けている… まあ、聞けよ… 座って、的になるなよ… あのスナイパーが、ええと… アンタを狙い撃ちにする！… そんなような、あの… ヤツらだ…。",
      "JA_new": "えっ？ああ！俺はスラヴィク……それはただのラベルだ……いや、エプロンだ！白いエプロンをしてる……ほら、見てくれ……座れよ、狙われるな……あのスナイパーが……撃ち抜くぞ！あいつら、ほら……そういう連中だからさ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_common3",
          "phrase_id": "309",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
